.it/2026/05/android-iphone-airdrop-quickshare-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"android-iphone-airdrop-quickshare\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":4,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14798,\"date\":\"2026-05-12T16:00:44+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-12T07:59:08+00:00\",\"slug\":\"11-motivi-per-aspettare-iphone-18-pro\",\"title\":\"11 motivi per aspettare iPhone 18 Pro\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo i rumor, iPhone 18 Pro potrebbe arrivare con cambiamenti su design, batteria, Dynamic Island, display, chip e modem, oltre a novità camera e connettività satellitare 5G.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Dynamic-Island-iPhone-18-Pro-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Dynamic-Island-iPhone-18-Pro-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14734,\"date\":\"2026-05-09T11:49:50+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-09T07:53:13+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-potrebbe-acquistare-chip-iphone-e-mac-da-intel\",\"title\":\"Apple potrebbe acquistare chip iPhone e Mac da Intel\",\"excerpt\":\"Dopo oltre un anno di discussioni, Apple e Intel avrebbero raggiunto un accordo preliminare: Intel produrrebbe processori basati su progetti Apple per dispositivi della casa di Cupertino.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Intel-Inside-iPhone-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Intel-Inside-iPhone-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://sec